  <names>
    <name lang="en">MDT SCN-DABC4.01 - Clear approximate front</name>
    <name lang="de">MDT SCN-DABC4.01 - Clear angenaeherte Front</name>
  </names>
  <informations>Unofficial simplified front illustration redrawn from official MDT photograph https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/_processed_/c/7/csm_SCN-DABC4-01_MDT_IMG_11_00_580f1cfa1f.png. Clear native regular Arial text, not pixel-traced lettering. This is an approximate layout, not a dimensionally/detail-exact manufacturer CAD conversion; pin details omitted. Front nominal envelope 72 x 90 mm, 2 drawing units/mm. No electrical connection terminals. Product source: https://www.mdt.de/produkte/produktdetail/dali-control-broadcast-gateway.html</informations>
